.
.  Generate a dex interaction effects matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na dexint1.ps
device 2 postscript
device 1 font simplex
thickness 0.2
.
SKIP 50
read JAHANMI2.DAT run lab bar set y x1 to x8 batch
let y1 = y
let y2 = y
retain y1 subset batch 1
retain y2 subset batch 2
skip 0
.
. Generate Matrix of Dex Interaction Effects
.
multiplot corner coordinates 10 5 90 95
multiplot scale factor 3.3
retain y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
ylimits 675 725
major ytic mark number 3
minor ytic mark number 3
xlimits -1 1
major xtic mark number 2
minor xtic mark number 1
tic label size 3
label size 3
y1label displacement 20
y2label displacement 25
char circle
char size 3
char fill on
line dash
tic offset units screen
tic offset 10 10
.
set matrix plot lower diagonal off
dex mean interaction effects plot y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv DEXINT1.PS dexint1.ps
. quit
